## Future Architecture

The planned evolution of TaskLock is:

```text
                         Client
                           |
                           v
                    Load Balancer
                           |
              ┌────────────┼────────────┐
              v            v            v
          FastAPI #1   FastAPI #2   FastAPI #3
              |            |            |
              └────────────┼────────────┘
                           |
              ┌────────────┴────────────┐
              |                         |
              v                         v
            Redis                  PostgreSQL
              |
              v
       Background Queue
              |
              v
         AI Worker
              |
       ┌──────┴──────┐
       v             v
   Vector DB        LLM
       |
       v
      RAG
```

The goal is to gradually transform TaskLock into a **scalable, cloud-deployed, AI-enabled backend system** while understanding the system-design decisions behind each component.

